{
  "name": "Turn text into animated GIFs from a form with the AI GIF Maker API",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0001-4b20-9c01-000000000001",
      "name": "GIF request form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -700,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000a16f0001",
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "AI GIF Maker: text to GIF",
        "formDescription": "Describe the GIF you want: what it shows and how it moves. It is made by AI GIF Maker (aigifmaker.ai) with your own API key and opens as soon as it is ready.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Prompt",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "placeholder": "A corgi in sunglasses dancing on a beach, looping",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0002-4b20-9c01-000000000002",
      "name": "Start GIF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -480,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "aigifmakerApiKey01",
          "name": "AI GIF Maker API key"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://aigifmaker.ai/api/ai/generate",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ provider: 'openlux', mediaType: 'image', model: 'gif-maker-v1', scene: 'text-to-image', prompt: $json['Prompt'], options: { output_format: 'gif' } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0003-4b20-9c01-000000000003",
      "name": "Accepted?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -260,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "accepted-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.code === 0 && !!($json.data && $json.data.id) }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0004-4b20-9c01-000000000004",
      "name": "Explain refusal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "reject-msg",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ ($json.data && $json.data.wall) ? 'AI GIF Maker needs an API key: create one at https://aigifmaker.ai/settings/apikeys and put it in the Header Auth credential as Bearer sk-...' : /invalid api key|no auth/i.test($json.message || '') ? 'AI GIF Maker did not accept the API key. Check the Header Auth credential value is Bearer sk-... (keys: https://aigifmaker.ai/settings/apikeys).' : /insufficient credits/i.test($json.message || '') ? 'The AI GIF Maker account is out of credits. Top up at https://aigifmaker.ai/pricing' : 'AI GIF Maker refused the prompt: ' + ($json.message || 'unknown error') + '. Try rewording it.' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0005-4b20-9c01-000000000005",
      "name": "Show refusal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.form",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -200
      ],
      "webhookId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000a16f0005",
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "completion",
        "completionTitle": "No GIF this time",
        "completionMessage": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0006-4b20-9c01-000000000006",
      "name": "Wait 10s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        40
      ],
      "webhookId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000a16f0006",
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 10,
        "unit": "seconds"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0007-4b20-9c01-000000000007",
      "name": "Check status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "aigifmakerApiKey01",
          "name": "AI GIF Maker API key"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://aigifmaker.ai/api/ai/query",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ taskId: $('Start GIF').item.json.data.id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0008-4b20-9c01-000000000008",
      "name": "Route by status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        400,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "s-done",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.code === 0 && $json.data.status === 'success' && ($json.data.images || []).length > 0 }}",
                    "rightValue": true,
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "operation": "true",
                      "singleValue": true
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "ready"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "s-failed",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.code !== 0 || ['failed', 'canceled'].includes($json.data && $json.data.status) }}",
                    "rightValue": true,
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "operation": "true",
                      "singleValue": true
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "failed"
            }
          ]
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "still making"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0009-4b20-9c01-000000000009",
      "name": "Open the GIF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.form",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        -140
      ],
      "webhookId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000a16f0009",
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "completion",
        "respondWith": "redirect",
        "redirectUrl": "={{ $json.data.images[0] }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0010-4b20-9c01-000000000010",
      "name": "Explain failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        640,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "fail-msg",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ 'The GIF did not finish on AI GIF Maker' + (($json.data && $json.data.errorMessage) || $json.message ? ': ' + (($json.data && $json.data.errorMessage) || $json.message) : '') + '. Its credit is refunded; try rewording the prompt.' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0011-4b20-9c01-000000000011",
      "name": "Show failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.form",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        860,
        60
      ],
      "webhookId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000a16f0011",
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "completion",
        "completionTitle": "The GIF failed",
        "completionMessage": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0012-4b20-9c01-000000000012",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Text to GIF from a form\n\nTurns a prompt typed into an n8n form into an animated GIF with **AI GIF Maker** (aigifmaker.ai). Native GIF generation, no video conversion.\n\nWhen the GIF is ready the form opens it directly; refusals and failures show a plain message saying what to fix.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 480
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0013-4b20-9c01-000000000013",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n\n1. Create an API key at aigifmaker.ai/settings/apikeys\n2. Add a **Header Auth** credential:\n   - Name: `Authorization`\n   - Value: `Bearer sk-...`\n3. Select it in **Start GIF** and **Check status**\n4. Activate the workflow and open the form URL\n\nEach GIF costs 1 credit on your AI GIF Maker account, the same as on the website.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a16f0000-0014-4b20-9c01-000000000014",
      "name": "Polling",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## How the wait works\n\nThe workflow checks every 10 seconds: `success` opens the GIF, `failed` / `canceled` explains why, anything else (pending, processing, or a short queue for accounts that have not bought credits) loops back to the wait.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 520
      }
    }
  ],
